WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:05.759
The SCP Foundation has encountered so many
bizarre and horrifying things at this point,

00:00:05.759 --> 00:00:10.059
that you might think there would be nothing
left in the world that could surprise them.

00:00:10.059 --> 00:00:14.610
But every so often, they happen upon something
that even these experts in the anomalous were

00:00:14.610 --> 00:00:16.250
not prepared for.

00:00:16.250 --> 00:00:21.270
In the Jabal al-Druze mountains of Syria,
they found one such thing.

00:00:21.270 --> 00:00:23.910
Well actually, it wasn’t a thing exactly.

00:00:23.910 --> 00:00:29.279
It was a place, filled with ancient secrets
and unimaginable power.

00:00:29.279 --> 00:00:36.390
On March 6, 2006, IAEA monitors began to pick
up radiation from within a cave complex approximately

00:00:36.390 --> 00:00:39.480
81 kilometers from El Taebah, Syria.

00:00:39.480 --> 00:00:42.969
They initially believed it to be the location
of a Syrian nuclear reactor.

00:00:42.969 --> 00:00:47.579
A number of Israeli air strikes were deployed
against the site, and the destruction revealed

00:00:47.579 --> 00:00:49.870
three mysterious chambers within.

00:00:49.870 --> 00:00:55.140
The Israeli and Syrian governments both established
contact with the SCP Foundation, and agents

00:00:55.140 --> 00:01:00.090
promptly responded to identify and contain
the anomalies present in the cave complex.

00:01:00.090 --> 00:01:04.769
There, they found not just one unusual thing,
but three.

00:01:04.769 --> 00:01:09.020
Inside the cave complex, a humanoid entity
was found carrying out some sort of ritual

00:01:09.020 --> 00:01:11.100
practice of unknown origins.

00:01:11.100 --> 00:01:16.000
It was reciting text in an unknown Southern
Semitic language, as well as performing a

00:01:16.000 --> 00:01:20.470
variety of other religious practices that
have been redacted from official records to

00:01:20.470 --> 00:01:23.980
prevent unauthorized staff from attempting
to perform them.

00:01:23.980 --> 00:01:31.220
These rituals have been designated SCP-1348-02,
and seem to be intended to prevent retraction

00:01:31.220 --> 00:01:35.890
of the veil protecting SCP-1348-03.

00:01:35.890 --> 00:01:37.870
But more on both of those later.

00:01:37.870 --> 00:01:45.480
The humanoid entity - designated SCP-1348-01-E
- was promptly contained and offered food,

00:01:45.480 --> 00:01:46.480
water, and bedding.

00:01:46.480 --> 00:01:51.530
It declined all of those, and, aside from
occasionally speaking in an unknown language,

00:01:51.530 --> 00:01:55.229
the entity made no attempts to speak to Foundation
staff.

00:01:55.229 --> 00:01:59.640
After three weeks in containment, the entity
had a seizure and died.

00:01:59.640 --> 00:02:03.770
An autopsy was scheduled, in order to understand
more about the being and where it might have

00:02:03.770 --> 00:02:04.829
come from.

00:02:04.829 --> 00:02:06.229
What was it doing there?

00:02:06.229 --> 00:02:07.990
And what was it protecting?

00:02:07.990 --> 00:02:12.450
Well, that takes us back to SCP-1348-02.

00:02:12.450 --> 00:02:17.040
The specific details of the rituals have been
kept secret due to the virulent memetic nature

00:02:17.040 --> 00:02:19.840
of the ritual practices themselves.

00:02:19.840 --> 00:02:25.540
Those exposed to the practices have an approximately
38% chance of experiencing religious mania

00:02:25.540 --> 00:02:30.810
and an intense desire to join in and perform
the ritual practices themselves.

00:02:30.810 --> 00:02:36.200
For unknown reasons, some people with specific
ancestry are more resistant to this memetic

00:02:36.200 --> 00:02:37.200
effect.

00:02:37.200 --> 00:02:42.790
The primary purpose of these rituals seems
to be to keep the veil covering SCP-1348-03

00:02:42.790 --> 00:02:45.010
closed.

00:02:45.010 --> 00:02:50.269
SCP-1348-03 is the central chamber of the
cave complex.

00:02:50.269 --> 00:02:54.640
Because of the high neutron flux present,
this is the area that was originally believed

00:02:54.640 --> 00:02:59.760
to be the storage site for a nuclear reactor
core or for high-grade radioactive waste.

00:02:59.760 --> 00:03:04.620
Neither are actually present, and instead
there is a rectangular chamber inside.

00:03:04.620 --> 00:03:10.350
Remote drone investigation revealed an elaborately
decorated room decorated in a proto-Semitic

00:03:10.350 --> 00:03:16.830
style, with repeated motifs of rams, serpents,
slaughtered bulls, wounded lions, hawks, and

00:03:16.830 --> 00:03:21.940
depictions of the SCP-1348-02 ritual practices.

00:03:21.940 --> 00:03:26.819
In the center of the room, there is a raised
platform with a radius of 9 meters, surrounded

00:03:26.819 --> 00:03:29.830
by a cylindrical sheath made of beryllium
bronze.

00:03:29.830 --> 00:03:35.550
At dawn, noon, and dusk, the sheath appears
to retract and cause the neutron flux inside

00:03:35.550 --> 00:03:38.240
of the chamber to raise to deadly levels.

00:03:38.240 --> 00:03:42.470
No one but those performing the rituals has
been able to see within the sheath, and the

00:03:42.470 --> 00:03:46.940
celebrants performing the rituals have refused
to say what they saw inside.

00:03:46.940 --> 00:03:51.970
So, what about the humanoid SCP-1348-01-E?

00:03:51.970 --> 00:03:54.300
What did the autopsy find?

00:03:54.300 --> 00:03:58.769
External examination revealed that it was
an anomalous human that originally had ten

00:03:58.769 --> 00:04:00.379
external limbs.

00:04:00.379 --> 00:04:05.610
Three of those limbs, both of its legs and
one of its many wings, had been amputated.

00:04:05.610 --> 00:04:10.390
The being’s body was injured in other ways,
including missing eyes and crushing injuries

00:04:10.390 --> 00:04:12.239
to the frontal sinuses.

00:04:12.239 --> 00:04:15.680
The entity did not appear to have any external
genitals.

00:04:15.680 --> 00:04:21.410
An internal examination revealed the presence
of a liver, lungs, heart, and brain, the absence

00:04:21.410 --> 00:04:24.530
of kidneys, and a lack of urinary tracks.

00:04:24.530 --> 00:04:28.550
There were no stomach contents, indicating
that the being may not have needed to eat

00:04:28.550 --> 00:04:29.570
to survive.

00:04:29.570 --> 00:04:35.770
However, in a confusing turn of events, the
cause of death was determined to be malnutrition.

00:04:35.770 --> 00:04:40.970
Site Director Benjamin Kahn was assigned to
head the research into 1348, working alongside

00:04:40.970 --> 00:04:44.710
a Research Director known in the file only
as Dr. X.

00:04:44.710 --> 00:04:50.050
Dr. X was the head of Containment Team B,
the containment team assigned to the interior

00:04:50.050 --> 00:04:51.590
of 1348.

00:04:51.590 --> 00:04:56.440
In one of their containment meetings, Dr.
Kahn and Dr. X began to argue about the safety

00:04:56.440 --> 00:05:01.500
of the continued containment methods, and
the possible danger of the anomaly itself.

00:05:01.500 --> 00:05:06.840
Dr. Kahn explained to Dr. X that the Overwatch
Council was threatening to shut Team B down,

00:05:06.840 --> 00:05:10.680
asking, “How are we supposed to protect
civilians from what’s in there if we don’t

00:05:10.680 --> 00:05:11.680
know what it is?”

00:05:11.680 --> 00:05:14.070
Dr. X responded, “He’s not dangerous.”

00:05:14.070 --> 00:05:19.430
At this time, Dr. X’s teeth were falling
out, and his skin was covered in sores from

00:05:19.430 --> 00:05:21.090
the radiation exposure.

00:05:21.090 --> 00:05:25.280
He insisted it was still not deliberately
dangerous, saying, “We’re not protecting

00:05:25.280 --> 00:05:28.500
the world from Him, we’re protecting Him
from the world.”

00:05:28.500 --> 00:05:33.610
Dr. Kahn saw this as proof that the memetics
of the rituals were beginning to affect Dr.

00:05:33.610 --> 00:05:34.610
X.

00:05:34.610 --> 00:05:38.020
Dr. X essentially confirmed this, saying,
“I used to think that there was some mistake.

00:05:38.020 --> 00:05:39.960
Then I passed the veil.

00:05:39.960 --> 00:05:41.830
Now I know it’s all for the best.”

00:05:41.830 --> 00:05:47.840
On December 5, 2011, Dr. X was found unconscious
in his quarters, suffering from radiation

00:05:47.840 --> 00:05:48.949
poisoning.

00:05:48.949 --> 00:05:51.670
His symptoms were severe, and it looked dire.

00:05:51.670 --> 00:05:56.660
Dr. Kahn, desperate for answers, sought approval
from the Overwatch Council to send an Omega-class

00:05:56.660 --> 00:06:04.191
ritual celebrant into the central chamber
of SCP-1348-03, also referred to as the Inner

00:06:04.191 --> 00:06:05.260
Sanctum.

00:06:05.260 --> 00:06:10.569
When he emerged, the Omega-Class was unresponsive
for three days before eventually speaking.

00:06:10.569 --> 00:06:14.630
Dr. Kahn conducted an interview with him to
seek answers.

00:06:14.630 --> 00:06:19.290
Kahn asked the man what he had seen inside,
and he said, “He is very old.

00:06:19.290 --> 00:06:20.770
He is hurting very badly.

00:06:20.770 --> 00:06:25.190
He is underwater, in space, and everywhere
else.

00:06:25.190 --> 00:06:27.120
He cannot get off his chair.

00:06:27.120 --> 00:06:30.260
He is stuck there forever because he is so
badly hurt.”

00:06:30.260 --> 00:06:33.389
Dr. Kahn asked how the being inside became
hurt.

00:06:33.389 --> 00:06:36.270
The man said, “I think we did something
bad.

00:06:36.270 --> 00:06:38.560
The song is about how bad we are.

00:06:38.560 --> 00:06:39.690
No, that's wrong.

00:06:39.690 --> 00:06:41.460
We didn't do anything bad.

00:06:41.460 --> 00:06:42.940
We weren't supposed to happen.

00:06:42.940 --> 00:06:43.940
We happened.

00:06:43.940 --> 00:06:45.699
It wasn't our fault that we happened.”

00:06:45.699 --> 00:06:50.690
He had trouble explaining himself, his mind
swimming from the pain and the injuries.

00:06:50.690 --> 00:06:53.210
He continued, “What he did saved us.

00:06:53.210 --> 00:06:54.610
Now he has to be punished.

00:06:54.610 --> 00:06:57.080
Now he has to stay behind the veil.”

00:06:57.080 --> 00:06:59.520
Dr. Kahn asked what the being was doing.

00:06:59.520 --> 00:07:01.960
The Omega Class said, “He was looking out.

00:07:01.960 --> 00:07:03.760
I saw that he saw us.

00:07:03.760 --> 00:07:05.590
We saw him.

00:07:05.590 --> 00:07:06.660
Others saw him.

00:07:06.660 --> 00:07:08.470
They weren't in the circle with us.

00:07:08.470 --> 00:07:12.240
They were standing outside the circle.

00:07:12.240 --> 00:07:15.520
Then we had to sing about how much he hurts
because of us.

00:07:15.520 --> 00:07:16.820
To make the veil close.

00:07:16.820 --> 00:07:19.160
So the others don't see him back.

00:07:19.160 --> 00:07:20.960
They are very angry.

00:07:20.960 --> 00:07:23.150
They don't remember things for very long.

00:07:23.150 --> 00:07:25.080
Less well than me, I guess.”

00:07:25.080 --> 00:07:30.580
The man was very tired, and asked to rest
and sleep, but Dr. Kahn had one more question.

00:07:30.580 --> 00:07:31.970
“Is he dangerous?”

00:07:31.970 --> 00:07:37.080
The man shook his head, and simply responded,
“He says he wants you to come home.

00:07:37.080 --> 00:07:38.220
He misses you.”

00:07:38.220 --> 00:07:44.030
Because SCP-1348 cannot be transported anywhere,
the Foundation put a series of containment

00:07:44.030 --> 00:07:49.660
measures in place on-site and set up a containment
team at the Site 87 Archaeological Containment

00:07:49.660 --> 00:07:52.520
Unit in the mountains where the anomaly is
located.

00:07:52.520 --> 00:07:58.050
The containment duties were split between
two teams, Team A and Team B. These teams

00:07:58.050 --> 00:08:02.639
were allowed limited contact - with the exception
of meetings between the Directors and inter-team

00:08:02.639 --> 00:08:06.900
meetings in Conference Room 2a - in order
to minimize any memetic cross-contamination.

00:08:06.900 --> 00:08:13.289
Containment Team A was made up of Foundation
employees recommended by Class 3 site supervisory

00:08:13.289 --> 00:08:18.490
personnel and could be disqualified at any
time for one of these reasons: membership

00:08:18.490 --> 00:08:24.990
in a religious faith, exposure to registered
memetic agents, and fluency in Amharic, Ge'ez,

00:08:24.990 --> 00:08:26.250
or Aramaic.

00:08:26.250 --> 00:08:32.760
Team A was responsible for providing ritual
supplies necessary for the performance of

00:08:32.760 --> 00:08:37.950
SCP-1348-02, keeping an eye on civilian celebrants
and Team B members, selecting those who would

00:08:37.950 --> 00:08:43.719
participate in all ritual behaviors, and providing
updated daily protocols for the rituals.

00:08:43.719 --> 00:08:48.890
They were also responsible for developing
and executing Protocol 228-MELECHAH, which

00:08:48.890 --> 00:08:52.770
could only be carried out by personnel who
have not been exposed to any recordings or

00:08:52.770 --> 00:08:59.990
transcripts of the rituals, or entered the
inner sanctum of SCP-1348-03.

00:08:59.990 --> 00:09:04.260
Containment Team B was made up of members
descended from Druze, Mandean, or Mizrahi

00:09:04.260 --> 00:09:06.070
Jewish populations.

00:09:06.070 --> 00:09:11.550
Their ancestry was thought to make them more
resilient to the memetic effects of SCP-1348,

00:09:11.550 --> 00:09:17.620
and able to perform the rituals of SCP-1348-02
without any adverse effects.

00:09:17.620 --> 00:09:23.220
They would follow strict guidelines to maintain
purity for these rituals, including a specific

00:09:23.220 --> 00:09:24.220
diet.

00:09:24.220 --> 00:09:28.820
Team B members were only permitted to exit
the containment area, access classified documents,

00:09:28.820 --> 00:09:33.790
or contact members of their families if written
permission was given by the Site Director.

00:09:33.790 --> 00:09:37.050
These containment procedures remained in place
for several years.

00:09:37.050 --> 00:09:44.250
However, in 2011, three days after the interview
with O-9142 and the death of Team B’s Director,

00:09:44.250 --> 00:09:48.860
Site Director Kahn did something that would
change the containment procedures for good.

00:09:48.860 --> 00:09:55.930
He prepared a new instance of SCP-1348-02
and entered the inner sanctum, without permission.

00:09:55.930 --> 00:10:01.490
He performed the ritual, and proceeded into
SCP-1348-03.

00:10:01.490 --> 00:10:03.640
He was never recovered from inside.

00:10:03.640 --> 00:10:08.040
The Foundation could not figure out what would
motivate Dr. Kahn to breach security in this

00:10:08.040 --> 00:10:11.540
way, to expose himself to danger and enter
the inner sanctum.

00:10:11.540 --> 00:10:16.450
Perhaps, they thought, he was acting out of
extreme distress following the death of his

00:10:16.450 --> 00:10:17.450
colleague.

00:10:17.450 --> 00:10:21.920
They investigated all of his personal writings,
his belongings, his emails, anything that

00:10:21.920 --> 00:10:25.270
could give them a clue about what had been
going on in his mind.

00:10:25.270 --> 00:10:30.610
Sometime later, a letter was returned, unopened,
to Dr. Kahn’s home address, and they got

00:10:30.610 --> 00:10:31.720
their answer.

00:10:31.720 --> 00:10:36.330
The contents of the letter caused the Foundation
to suspend containment Team B, believing that

00:10:36.330 --> 00:10:41.519
their ancestry was no longer sufficient protection
from the memetic effects of SCP-1348.

00:10:41.519 --> 00:10:45.440
The letter was from Dr. Kahn to his daughter,
Judith.

00:10:45.440 --> 00:10:49.320
He began the letter by saying it was the last
one he would ever write.

00:10:49.320 --> 00:10:52.050
Clearly, he knew he was going to die soon.

00:10:52.050 --> 00:10:56.610
In his letter, he confessed his work for the
Foundation and apologized to her for his actions

00:10:56.610 --> 00:10:57.860
throughout her life.

00:10:57.860 --> 00:11:01.770
He was absent a lot of her life, while she
believed he was some kind of spy.

00:11:01.770 --> 00:11:06.010
In truth, he was working for the Foundation
and forced to hide that from her.

00:11:06.010 --> 00:11:10.930
He apologized to her for disowning her over
religion, abandoning his relationship with

00:11:10.930 --> 00:11:15.390
her when she married, and left to study the
Torah and dedicate herself to her faith.

00:11:15.390 --> 00:11:17.450
He wrote, “But I was wrong, Judith.

00:11:17.450 --> 00:11:18.920
What does the Torah tell us?

00:11:18.920 --> 00:11:24.190
That the Name once moved upon the water; that
He broke bread with Abraham, that He wrestled

00:11:24.190 --> 00:11:29.190
with Jacob and broke his thigh, that He buried
Moses in the clay beside the Jordan.

00:11:29.190 --> 00:11:34.320
But now the Temple is a ruin, the people of
Moses are scattered, and we have lost even

00:11:34.320 --> 00:11:35.320
the Name.

00:11:35.320 --> 00:11:39.660
For so long, I have stood on the edge of the
chasm which separates us, demanding that He

00:11:39.660 --> 00:11:40.660
explain.

00:11:40.660 --> 00:11:44.320
When you married Eleizer, and you covered
your hair, I thought you were abandoning me.

00:11:44.320 --> 00:11:49.040
But you were seeking after the Name which
I had abandoned, unafraid to cast your forgiveness

00:11:49.040 --> 00:11:50.560
into the depths of the mystery.

00:11:50.560 --> 00:11:55.339
If you were unafraid, even as a child, why
have I hesitated for so long?”

00:11:55.339 --> 00:12:00.639
He planned to face the mystery, to look into
the depths he had avoided for his entire life.

00:12:00.639 --> 00:12:05.050
He concluded the letter, detailing his plans
to breach containment and walk into the heart

00:12:05.050 --> 00:12:07.270
of SCP-1348: “It is late.

00:12:07.270 --> 00:12:08.790
I am tired.

00:12:08.790 --> 00:12:13.970
Tomorrow, I will anoint myself with oil, I
will bathe in the font, and I will speak His

00:12:13.970 --> 00:12:14.980
terrible name.

00:12:14.980 --> 00:12:19.970
When the sun rises, I will stand before my
broken father, and the fathers who were broken

00:12:19.970 --> 00:12:23.580
before him, as someday you will stand before
me, as someday you will stand before Him.

00:12:23.580 --> 00:12:25.850
I will be held to account for my absence.

00:12:25.850 --> 00:12:28.470
I will hold the Name to account for His.

00:12:28.470 --> 00:12:29.860
And I will forgive Him.”

00:12:29.860 --> 00:12:34.519
Who knows what happened once Dr. Kahn passed
through the veil into the inner sanctum, giving

00:12:34.519 --> 00:12:36.899
himself up for what he believed in?

00:12:36.899 --> 00:12:41.959
Maybe he did find and share that forgiveness
and attain the peace he so desperately sought.

00:12:41.959 --> 00:12:47.320
Perhaps, in his communion with the injured
protector, trapped forever behind the veil,

00:12:47.320 --> 00:12:50.880
he could find the strength to forgive himself,
too.

00:12:50.880 --> 00:12:56.851
Now go check out “SCP-001- Scarlet King
- Dust and Blood” and “SCP-2718 - What

00:12:56.851 --> 00:13:00.920
Happens After Death” for more anomalies
of truly cosmic proportions!

